| 3 | Services, Ingress, and Kubernetes networking | `Service` (ClusterIP, NodePort, LoadBalancer) `Ingress`, DNS |
| 4 | Configuration and storage | `ConfigMap` `Secret` `PersistentVolume` `PersistentVolumeClaim` |
| 5 | Health checks, resource requests and limits, scaling, rolling updates, rollback | probes, `HorizontalPodAutoscaler`, `rollout` |
| 6 | Troubleshooting labs | `describe` `logs` `events` `top` `port-forward` |
| 7 | Mini-project: deploy backend, database, and cache | |
| 8 | Review, security basics, and comparison with Compose and cloud services | |

This topic extends Stage 3 and Stage 5 of the main project: the Compose stack becomes a Kubernetes deployment.

